 Celestia is registered in RERA under multiple projects as follows: Celestia **A Wing P51800011623, Celestia A1 Wing P51800010810, Celestia B Wing P51800004768.**\n\nThe project offers splendid residential units with top-class specifications that meet the expectations of the urban population’s lifestyle. Yet, Bhoomi Celestia ensures well-being and an easy life with all the necessary residential facilities for property owners in this project. With its offerings of 2, 3, and 4 BHK residential apartments,  these residences mark Bhoomi Celestia as one of the most detailed yet affordable residential projects in Malad West, Mumbai. This is a completely Vaastu-compliant project.\n\n#### LEVELS of COMFORT\n\nYour internal living space has been designed for ultra-luxurious living.\n\n* Living & Bedroom\n* Vitrified flooring\n* Extensive Electrical Layout\n* Windows with granite sills\n* Cable, Telephone & AC\n* Granite Kitchen Platform\n* Stainless Steel Sink\n\n* Auxiliary Platform\n* Refrigerator Point\n* Anti-skid Flooring\n* Stainless Steel Sink\n* Glazed Dado Tiles\n* Quality Sanitaryware\n* Modular Switches\n\n#### LEVELS of Clubhouse\n\nThe grand three-level Clubhouse welcomes you via a splendid double-height lobby reception giving you all you need to live a full life right at home.\n\n* Game Zone Area\n* Library\n* Banquet Hall\n\n* Business Center\n* Gymnasium\n* Spa\n\n#### LEVELS of CONNECTION\n\n**Nearby Places**\n\n* Nagindas Khandwala College\n* Shree Nutan Vidya Mandir English\n* ASPEE AUDITORIUM\n* Witty International School\n* Lifeline Multispecialty Hospital\n* Malad Telephone Exchange\n* Malad Railway Station\n* Jain Mandir\n* Orlem Church\n* St. Anne’s High School\n\n##### Available\n\n#### 3BHK | Residential Apartment | with Decks | Flats | Malad West | on Sale\n\nBhoomiCelestia#MaladWest#2BHK#3BHK#4BHK#BalconyFlats#ReadyWithOC#MarveRoad#LinkRoad\n\n## Amenities & Features\n\nBanquet Hall\n\nBarbeque Area\n\nCar Parking\n\nCCTV Security\n\nClub House\n\n