estia project has 3 Wings each of  34 Storeys (Wing A, A1 & B)\n* Located at Aspee Enclave, Marve Road, Opp SNDT College in **Malad West**. Bhoomi Celestia is one of the projects developed by the **Bhoomi Group**\n* **Bhoomi Celestia was launched in Jan 2014 and the possession of the same is likely to be in Dec 2020.**\n* **Bhoomi Celestia is RERA approved has the Registration Number bearing** **- Wing A : P51800004768 | Wing A1 : P51800010810 | Wing B : P5180004768**\n* Spread over 7.5 Acres of land\n* Modular Kitchen\n* Lush green Landscape Area\n* Vastu Compliant Home\n* **Bhoomi Celestia has good reviews and the ratings of this project are approximately 4 out of 5.**\n\nBhoomi Group also has other under construction and ready possession and sold out projects like Bhoomi Samkit, Bhoomi Darshan, Bhoomi Valley, Bhoomi Hills, Bhoomi Fields, Bhoomi Sarashwati, Rock Enclave, Bhoomi Breeze, Rock Avenue, Bhoomi Acres, Bhoomi Aura, Bhoomi Park, Bhoomi Flora, Bhoomi Heights, Bhoomi Elegant, Bhoomi Legend, Bhoomi Celestia, Bhoomi Shiv Shakti , Bhoomi Acres , Bhoomi Harmony, Bhoomi Gobind Bhavan, Bhoomi Diamond, Bhoomi Vandana, Bhoomi Samarth.   \n  \n The property prices in Malad West are in the range of 13500 to 18500 for Outright for ready and under construction projects.  \n  \n Bhoomi Group currently has 2 Ready Possession, 5 Under Construction projects.\n\nYou can download the brochure of Bhoomi Celestia and you can see the latest digital pictures, Floor Plans, Location Plans & Rate History on our website.   \n The Bookings for the Under Construction project Bhoomi Celestia are open and we can set up a Site Visit any time at your Convenience.  \n Bhoomi Celestia is approved by most of the Banks and for more details on the approved bank list, please connect with us.\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2021\n\nRevised\n\nDec 2021\n\nStatus\n\nOngoing\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n3 BHK1,302–1,337 