e approximately Rs. 1.4 Lac/month over a 30-year tenure. Currently, 14 properties are up for sale by owners and dealers, giving buyers multiple options to explore. Chandak Treesourus, Narang Vivenda, Mahindra Marina64, Yukti Anchorpoint Aviara, Ruparel Stardom are some nearby under-construction projects. Nearby options include Transcon Auris Serenity, Raj Infinia, K Raheja Interface Heights, Gurukrupa Marina Enclave, Transcon & Sheth Auris Bliss, all of which are ready-to-move societies.\n\n### Bhoomi Celestia Floor Plan\n\n| Unit Configuration | Unit Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| Bhoomi Celestia 2 BHK Flat | 725 Sq. Ft. |\n| Bhoomi Celestia 3 BHK Flat | 887 Sq. Ft. |\n| Bhoomi Celestia 3 BHK Flat | 873 Sq. Ft. |\n To get an idea into the way the house is structured and how the rooms and other spaces interact with each other, view the floor plans of the units. The various units in Bhoomi Celestia come in 3 different configurations and have 5 types of layouts. Bathrooms with contemporary fittings and balconies that allow for easy ventilation are part of the configurations. All the various configurations of Bhoomi Celestia are available on Magicbricks for your reference.\n\n### Bhoomi Celestia Brochure\n\n If Bhoomi Celestia appeals to you, learn more about this well-designed project by downloading their PDF brochure. This brochure can be easily accessed from the top right end of the page, where you will see the link of 'Download Brochure'. To view the Bhoomi Celestia brochure PDF, fill in your details like name, contact number, and email ID.\n\n### How is the Malad West Real Estate Market?\n\n In the July 2026 quarter, the average cost of a multistorey apartment in Malad West stands at Rs. 22,130/sq. ft, while property prices generally vary between Rs. 16,853 and Rs. 27,408/sq. ft, appealing to a broad range of homebuyers and investors. Rental yield in the Malad West area of Mumbai is currently 3.56% for residential properties. As indicated by 383 resident feedback, Malad West has a rating of 4.07/5.For a quick shopping or outing plan, you can visit World of Titan Infiniti mall and Mothercare. Veer Bhagat Singh Vidyalaya and Atharva Institute of Management Studies are notable schools conveniently located within walking reach of the project.\n\nProject Summary is Ai Generated\n\nKey Highlights\n\nAmenities\n\nClub House\n\n★\n\nPower Back Up\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nSecurity\n\nReserved Parking\n\nBanquet Hall\n\nGymnasium\n\nIndoor Games Room\n\nFlower Gardens\n\nRain Water Harvesting\n\nInternet/Wi-Fi Connectivity\n\nCCTV Camera\n\nFire Sprinklers\n\nEntry Exit Gate\n\nKids play area\n\nSpecifications & Key USPs of\n\nBhoomi Celestia\n\nSpecifications\n\nKey USPs\n\n*   Design as per green building concept.\n*   Earthquake resistant R.C.C. structure.\n*   Well carved exteriors and elevation as per architect's design.\n*   11'-0- clear height.\n*   Mivan technology for efficient and precise construction.\n*   5 synchronized high speed passenger elevators of 18 person capacity for vertical circulation.\n*   1 stretcher elevator.\n*   Glass railing in bedrooms & living room open areas.\n*   Italian marble & granite flooring in common areas.\n*   All naturally cross ventilated apartments as vastu confirmed.\n*   Branded vitrified tiles in bedroom, living room & kitchen.\n*   Wooden flooring in master bedroom.\n*   Aluminum frame sliding windows.\n*   Designer sanitary fixtures and plumbing fixtures in toilets as per architect's design.\n*   Toilets with designer dado tiles & non slippery floor tiles.\n*   Modular kitchen.\n*   Provision of garbage chute on floor lobby.\n*   Fire Fighting System.\n*   Fire Alarm system on each level.\n*   Provision of wet riser in each staircase.\n*   Sprinkler system in common areas and in the stilt & podiums.\n*   Smoke detector system on each level.\n*   Fire escape exits as per plan.\n*   Refuge space as per design.\n\n*   Near Fire Brigade\n*   Next to Jankalyan Nagar, Marve Road\n*   Restaurants : Blue Heaven Kh 1km\n*   Coffee : Barista 9km\n*   Shopping : Mitesh Medical and General Store 2km\n*   Schools : Saint Jude's School 1km\n*   Parks : Prime machine co. Pvt Ltd. 20km\n\nWhat People Say\n\nOverall\n\nPositive\n\nNeeds Improvement\n\nThe locality is clean, well-maintained, and offers excellent amenities, including supermarkets, parks, and convenient public transportation. It features quality healthcare, education, and vibrant nightlife, with spacious homes at reasonable prices. However, drawbacks include limited non-vegetarian food options, poor hotel food quality, traffic congestion, inadequate nighttime security, poor road conditions, rising pollution levels, and waterlogging during the rainy season. Overall, Malad West is attractive but has notable challenges.Read Less\n\nThe locality is clean and well-maintained, with excellent amenities, including nearby supermarkets, parks, and gardens. Public transportation is convenient, with a local train station and metro within walking distance. The area boasts quality healthcare and education facilities, vibrant nightlife, and a variety of local eateries. Spacious homes are available at reasonable prices, and the community is safe and secure. Malad West offers great connectivity to major roads and is close to beaches, making it an attractive place to live.Read Less\n\nLimited non-vegetarian food options and poor hotel food quality are notable drawbacks. The area suffers from traffic congestion, inadequate security at night, and poor road conditions, including a lack of streetlights. Pollution levels are rising, and waterlogging occurs during the rainy season. Public transport is infrequent, and high property demand leads to increased rental costs.Read Less\n\nAI generated summary from Magicbricks reviews and on-ground insights.\n\nPublic transport\n\n Quality healthcare\n\n Education facilities\n\n Clean environment\n\nTraffic issues\n\n Night security\n\n Road quality\n\n Air pollution\n\n## Ratings & Reviews\