rea of 725 sq.ft 1]()\n\n## Bhoomi Celestia Photos & Videos\n\n![Bhoomi Celestia Project Tour 1](https://img.youtube.com/vi/OaMSdKDhKpc/hqdefault.jpg)\n![Bhoomi Celestia More Images 1](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/329d0c49d339c9b963b0dac0fd5ff0ce/v0/medium/bhoomi_celestia-malad_west-mumbai-bhoomi_group.jpeg)\n![Bhoomi Celestia Elevation 1](https://housing-images.n7net.in/012c1500/1d29125b2b398eb5821074d649e7c21d/v0/medium.jpeg)\n![Bhoomi Celestia Images for Elevation of Bhoomi Celestia 2](https://housing-images.n7net.in/012c1500/325ab41250c5d4abe5499266bf4fb242/v0/medium.jpeg)\n\n## Bhoomi Celestia Top Amenities\n\n![]()\n\n## Bhoomi Celestia Specifications\n\n### Floor & Counter\n\n![](//c.housingcdn.com/demand/s/client/common/assets/floorCounterTab.65d21b4c.svg)\n\n### Fitting\n\n![](//c.housingcdn.com/demand/s/client/common/assets/fittingTab.01cbbe4c.svg)\n\n### Wall & Ceiling\n\n![](//c.housingcdn.com/demand/s/client/common/assets/wallsCeilingTab.31601368.svg)\n\n### Bhoomi Celestia Ratings & Reviews Malad West 4.4/5\n\n## Bhoomi Celestia Ratings & Reviews\n\nNow you can see Rating & Review in one place for both Project & Locality!\n\n### Ratings based on features\n\n4.5/5\n\n4.4/5\n\n4.4/5\n\n4.4/5\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  1 year ago\n\n**2 Users** found this review helpful\n\n#### Good things here\n\ni am the owner of this locality and I can confidently said this place absolutely amazing for home seekers and students because here I can find different types of facilities in few walkable distance. here different types of educational institute are available and a lot shopping complexes are available with affordable price.the area provide house in low price.read more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nthe bad instinct about this locality are frequent traffic jam and a lot of pollution. there are no parks so parking issue can be challenging.read more\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  1 year ago\n\n**1 User** found this review helpful\n\n#### Good things here\n\nThe public transport is excellent with the cabs conveniently located and making travel easy. It boasts numerous well-kept parks. Markets are conveniently located near shops catering to vegetarian and non-vegetarian needs. The roads are well-connected and in excellent condition. Nearby hospitals, schools and gyms are available. D-MART is also present for grocery shopping.read more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nThe area's high population density leads to frequent traffic jams and pollution. The lack of proper maintenance by the municipal corporation of Mumbai results in hygiene issues. Auto rickshaw drivers often speed recklessly to attract more passengers. Construction work has lead to roads filled with potholes and a scarcity of parking spacesread more\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  2 years ago\n\n#### Good things here\n\nthis location is very good but maintain cleaning for some reason our face are dry and pollution and acne and darkness spot on your face so please maintain this issues. by the way this is very best locationread more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nI know this location good but traffic pollution and noise pollution is very high amount of source and vehicle aree very fast speed drive and big amount of vehicle areee available.read more\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  2 years ago\n\n**1 User** found this review helpful\n\n#### Good things here\n\nall schools and hospitals colleges for nearby between 5 to 10 km I also have a office nearby so I travel vockable distance from home to my workshop,read more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nthis like you sometimes this lot of people so much crowded just because it is crowded there are lot of shops and everything is accessible milk kirana shop fish market meet mutton everything is just Pro Kabaddiread more\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  2 years ago\n\n#### Good things here\n\nIt was like very good area in Mumbai and this place is also overcrowded with the people. The power cuts are faced like none The roads are good, but in monsoon, they can’t face the over logging of water And about the transportation, there is very crowded transportation with people, but easy to accessread more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nI just dislike about this place. Is this place is not in over hype but still count in posh area and the prices of flats are to aver hype the station side road is too low in quality but market is vary good nd cheap tooread more\n\n55 Reviews\n\n## Price Trends for Bhoomi Celestia vs. Malad West\n\n+\n\nADD MORE\n\nto compare\n\n## Property Registery Records of Bhoomi Celestia\n\nGovernment Registered Transactions & Property Rates\n\n### Recent Registries in Bhoomi Celestia\n\nData Source : Maharashtra Government\n\n| Date | Agreement Price | Area(sq.ft) | Rate/sq.ft | Flat & Floor No. | Tower | Transaction Type |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 Sep, 2026 | [View Price](/transaction/projects/38527) | 975 sq.ft super built-up area |  | 3117,  31st    Floor | A | sale |\n| 1 Sep, 2026 | [View Price](/transaction/projects/38527) | 975 sq.ft super built-up area |  | 3118,  31st    Floor | A | sale |\n| 1 Sep, 2026 | [View Price](/transaction/projects/38527) | 797 sq.ft super built-up area |  | 915,  9th    Floor | - | sale |\n| 1 Sep, 2026 | [View Price](/transaction/projects/38527) | 975 sq.ft super built-up area |  | 2317,  23rd    Floor | - | sale |\n| 1 Sep, 2026 | [View Price](/transaction/projects/38527) | 1,432 sq.ft super built-up area |  | 3004,  30th    Floor | - | sale |\n\nsuper built-up area\n\nsuper built-up area\n\nsuper built-up area\n\nsuper built-up area\n\nsuper built-up area\n\nLearn about new registry records in Bhoomi Celestia\n\n## Bhoomi Celestia Official Brochure\n\n![Bhoomi Celestia Brochure 1](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/a627922e551bee14e9cf0e03490366f4/v0/medium.jpg)\n![Bhoomi Celestia Brochure 2](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/af0f43c63eb35b8f9c6d0705b4abef4e/v0/medium.jpg)\n![Bhoomi Celestia Brochure 3](https://housing-images.