2 Photos\n\n![Bhoomi Celestia](https://assets.nobroker.in/media/building/8a9fc58288665dbb01886695db60248c/images/8a9fc58288665dbb01886695db60248c_interior_image_sfPmQcAqzG1748599019806_85751_iris_medium.jpg)\n![Rera](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/reraProjectInfo.svg)\n![share](/nb-ReactNextNew/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.nobroker.in%2Fnob-common%2FShareNew_react_443425.webp&w=48&q=75)\n\n# Bhoomi Celestia\n\n![pointer](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pointerProjectInfo.svg)\n![Bhoomi Group logo](https://assets.nobroker.in/media/building/8a9fc58288665dbb01886695db60248c/logo/8a9fc58288665dbb01886695db60248c_logo_xFK3zsTkMD1748598082022.jpg)\n\n## By Bhoomi Group\n\n![formard](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/ArrowForwardBlack_nbReact_453525.svg)\n![house](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/houseProjectInfo.svg)\n![drop](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/dropProjectInfo.svg)\n![building](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/buildingProjectInfo.svg)\n![building](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/buildingProjectInfo.svg)\n![frame](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/frameProjectInfo.svg)\n![claim](/nb-ReactNextNew/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.nobroker.in%2Fnob-merchandise%2FclaimbenefitsIcon_nbReact221sor.webp&w=3840&q=75)\n![right](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/rightArrowProjectInfo.svg)\n![download](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/downloadProjectInfo.svg)\n\n## Key Features\n\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n\n## Bhoomi Celestia Floor Plans\n\n## Amenities in Bhoomi Celestia\n\n![show more](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/greenDropDownIcn.svg)\n\n## About the Bhoomi Celestia\n\n**Bhoomi Celestia offers luxurious housing in the heart of Mumbai, Maharashtra. It spans 7.5 acres and comprises 540 units in 2,3, and 4 BHK configurations, with carpet areas ranging from 725 sq. ft. to 1770 sq. ft. Bhoomi Celestia’s prices start from Rs. 2.8 Crore to Rs. 6.2 Crore, offering an ideal blend of luxury and urban living in Mumbai. Key amenities include landscape areas, a jogging track, a clubhouse, and a children’s play area. Situated close to educational institutions, major hospitals, and public transport, Bhoomi Celestia’s location ensures excellent connectivity for its residents.**\n\n## **Bhoomi Celestia Overview**\n\n**Land area & units: 7.5 acres| 3 towers | 540 units**\n\n**Storeys: 34 Storeys**\n\n**Landmark & Nearby hub: Near Shri M. D. Shah Mahila College of Arts and Commerce**\n\n**Possession Date: May 2025**\n\n**RERA: P51800011623**\n\n**Address: Aspee Enclave, Marve Rd, Malad, Kanchpada, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400064**\n\n**Google Map: [Bhoomi Celestia location](https://www.google.com/maps/place/Bhoomi+Celestia/@19.1907207,72.8405464,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x3be7b6e5d98ba107:0x3c10950fc5cf9b60!8m2!3d19.1907207!4d72.8405464!16s%2Fg%2F11c61x6v9z!5m1!1e1?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTAyOS4yIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D)**\n\n## **Configuration and Price Ranges**\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Configuration | Carpet Area | Price |\n| 2 BHK | 725 sq. ft. | On Request |\n| 3 BHK | 887 sq. ft. | On Request |\n| 4 BHK | 1,770 sq. ft. | On Request |\n\nConfiguration \n\nCarpet Area\n\nPrice\n\n2 BHK\n\n725 sq. ft.\n\nOn Request\n\n3 BHK\n\n887 sq. ft.\n\nOn Request\n\n4 BHK\n\n1,770 sq. ft.\n\nOn Request\n\n## **Why invest?**\n\n**Elevated living with high ceilings: Bhoomi Celestia apartments offer spacious interiors with 3.4-meter ceilings that enhance ventilation, natural light, and the overall sense of luxury.**\n\n**Ready-to-move advantage: The possession of Bhoomi Celestia began in May 2025, ensuring immediate possession and a secure investment for its residents.**\n\n**Prime Malad West location: Strategically situated with excellent connectivity to schools, business hubs, and entertainment zones, Bhoomi Celestia’s location offers both convenience and strong value growth potential.**\n\n## **Amenities Offered at Bhoomi Celestia**\n\n**Bhoomi Celestia amenities are designed for everyday comfort, relaxation, and community living.**\n\n### **Leisure Spaces**\n\n**Landscaped Areas**\n\n**Sit-out Areas**\n\n**Picnic Lawns**\n\n**Senior Citizen Area**\n\n### **Kids’ Zone**\n\n**Kids’ Play Area**\n\n### **Active Living Hub**\n\n**Jogging/Walking Track**\n\n### **Community Space**\n\n**Clubhouse**\n\n## **Location and Connectivity**\n\n**Bhoomi Celestia is located in [Malad West,](https://www.nobroker.in/new-projects-in-malad-west-mumbai) Mumbai.**\n\n**Malad West is a well-developed residential hub in Mumbai, known for its excellent connectivity, robust infrastructure, and vibrant lifestyle. It offers a balanced mix of luxury and mid-segment housing, proximity to major commercial hubs, reputed schools, malls, and recreational spaces, making it ideal for families and professionals.**\n\n**Carmel of St. Joseph School: 550 m**\n\n**St. Anne International School: 750 m**\n\n**Dayanand Anglo Vedic Public School: 1.2 km**\n\n**Shri M. D. Shah Mahila College of Arts and Commerce: 130 m**\n\n**Children Welfare Centre's College of Law: 650 m**\n\n**Smt. K. G. Mittal Institute of Management: 1.1 km**\n\n**Sun Multispeciality Hospital: 140 m**\n\n**Garg Multispeciality Hospital: 900 m**\n\n**Adarsh Hospital: 1.1 km**\n\n**Malad West Metro Station: 1.3 km**\n\n**Malad Railway Station: 1.6 km**\n\n**Infiniti Mall: 1.7 km**\n\n## **Construction & Delivery Timeline**\n\n**Bhoomi Celestia is a completed project, and possession has already begun in May 2025.**\n\n## **Summary**\n\n**Bhoomi Celestia is a modern residential project in Malad West offering homes with lifestyle amenities and excellent connectivity.**\n\n### **Pros**\n\n**Large 7.5-acre land parcel with extensive open & clubhouse amenities.**\n\n**Ready-to-move apartments in the prime Malad West location.**\n\n### **Cons**\n\n**High maintenance charges for luxurious amenities.**\n\n**Traffic congestion during peak hours in Malad West.**\n\n## Bhoomi Celestia - RERA & Legal Certificates\n\n![view](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Eye.svg)\n\nThe Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 is Act of the Parliament of India which seeks to protect buyers as well as help boost investments in the real estate industry. The Act came into force from 1 May 2016.\n\n![copy](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Copy.svg)\n![copy](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Copy.svg)\n![approved](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/rera_approved_seal.png)\n![Timely Dispute Resolution](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Question.svg)\n![Quality Assurance](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/SealCheck.svg)\n![Buyer Protection](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/ShieldCheck.svg)\n![Transparency & Tracking](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/FileMagnifyingGlass.svg)\n\n## Bhoomi Celestia - Neighbourhood\n\n![](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/CTAbg.webp)\n\n### Looking for your dream home?\n\n![svg](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/house.svg)\n![svg](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/lightbulb-filament.svg)\n![svg](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/ListChecks.svg)\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/rightArrowWhite.svg)\n\n## Compare Projects\n\n## Price Trend for Bhoomi Celestia\n\n![connect_img](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/connectPropertyImg.webp)\n\n## Top Developers in Mumbai\n\n## Builders\n\nNo builders found\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### Where is Bhoomi Celestia located?\n\n### What is the available Apartment size in Bhoomi Celestia?\n\n### What is the RERA Number of Bhoomi Celestia of Malad West?\n\n### What is the price range of Bhoomi Celestia of Malad West?\n\n### Where to download the Bhoomi Celestia brochure?\n\n### Where to download the Bhoomi Celestia floor plan?\n\